   "tone": "dark"
  },
  {
   "id": "s32",
   "text": "There is a cruel twist in all of this. Those digital patents were worth real money, so in the end Kodak sold part of its past to people building the future. The invention was valuable. The company just never managed to turn it into its own future.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "scene3d",
    "location": "office",
    "light": "office",
    "cast": [
     {
      "palette": "clerk",
